# digitaljs.ys — the exact synthesis DigitalJS Online runs in your browser,
# run here instead, so you can compare and keep the picture.
#
#   yosys scripts/digitaljs.ys
#
# This command list is copied from yosys2digitaljs (the converter behind
# digitaljs.tilk.eu), src/core.ts, prepare_yosys_script(), with every
# checkbox left at its default. There is no cell library anywhere in it:
# the browser stops at generic gates, which is exactly why DD103 exists.

read_verilog -sv src/full_adder.sv
setattr -mod -unset top
hierarchy -auto-top
proc
opt_clean
memory -nomap
wreduce -memx
opt_clean
stat
show -format svg -prefix results/full_adder_rtl -notitle
